[{"s":108,"a":3,"en":"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["شَانِئَكَ","your enemy"],["هُوَ","he (is)"],["ٱلۡأَبۡتَرُ","the one cut off"]]},{"s":26,"a":107,"en":"Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger.","w":[["إِنِّي","Indeed,I am"],["لَكُمۡ","to you"],["رَسُولٌ","a Messenger"],["أَمِينٞ","trustworthy"]]},{"s":113,"a":4,"en":"And from the evil of the blowers in knots","w":[["وَمِن","And from"],["شَرِّ","(the) evil"],["ٱلنَّفَّـٰثَٰتِ","(of) the blowers"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلۡعُقَدِ","the knots"]]},{"s":56,"a":25,"en":"They will not hear therein ill speech or commission of sin -","w":[["لَا","Not"],["يَسۡمَعُونَ","they will hear"],["فِيهَا","therein"],["لَغۡوٗا","vain talk"],["وَلَا","and not"],["تَأۡثِيمًا","sinful (speech)"]]},{"s":112,"a":1,"en":"Say, \"He is Allah, [who is] One,","w":[["قُلۡ","Say"],["هُوَ","He"],["ٱللَّهُ","(is) Allah"],["أَحَدٌ","the One"]]},{"s":67,"a":25,"en":"And they say, \"When is this promise, if you should be truthful?\"","w":[["وَيَقُولُونَ","And they say"],["مَتَىٰ","When"],["هَٰذَا","(is) this"],["ٱلۡوَعۡدُ","promise"],["إِن","if"],["كُنتُمۡ","you are"],["صَٰدِقِينَ","truthful"]]},{"s":11,"a":2,"en":"[Through a messenger, saying], \"Do not worship except Allah. Indeed, I am to you from Him a warner and a bringer of good tidings,\"","w":[["أَلَّا","That \" Not"],["تَعۡبُدُوٓاْ","you worship"],["إِلَّا","but"],["ٱللَّهَۚ","Allah"],["إِنَّنِي","Indeed,I am"],["لَكُم","to you"],["مِّنۡهُ","from Him"],["نَذِيرٞ","a warner"],["وَبَشِيرٞ","and a bearer of glad tidings"]]},{"s":72,"a":20,"en":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"I only invoke my Lord and do not associate with Him anyone.\"","w":[["قُلۡ","Say"],["إِنَّمَآ","Only"],["أَدۡعُواْ","I call upon"],["رَبِّي","my Lord"],["وَلَآ","and not"],["أُشۡرِكُ","I associate"],["بِهِۦٓ","with Him"],["أَحَدٗا","anyone"]]},{"s":31,"a":8,"en":"Indeed, those who believe and do righteous deeds - for them are the Gardens of Pleasure.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who"],["ءَامَنُواْ","believe"],["وَعَمِلُواْ","and do"],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ","righteous deeds"],["لَهُمۡ","for them"],["جَنَّـٰتُ","(are) Gardens"],["ٱلنَّعِيمِ","(of) Delight"]]},{"s":38,"a":1,"en":"Sad. By the Qur'an containing reminder...","w":[["صٓۚ","Saad"],["وَٱلۡقُرۡءَانِ","By the Quran"],["ذِي","full (of) reminder"],["ٱلذِّكۡرِ","full (of) reminder"]]},{"s":9,"a":82,"en":"So let them laugh a little and [then] weep much as recompense for what they used to earn.","w":[["فَلۡيَضۡحَكُواْ","So let them laugh"],["قَلِيلٗا","a little"],["وَلۡيَبۡكُواْ","and let them weep"],["كَثِيرٗا","much"],["جَزَآءَۢ","(as) a recompense"],["بِمَا","for what"],["كَانُواْ","they used to"],["يَكۡسِبُونَ","earn"]]},{"s":32,"a":18,"en":"Then is one who was a believer like one who was defiantly disobedient? They are not equal.","w":[["أَفَمَن","Then is one who"],["كَانَ","is"],["مُؤۡمِنٗا","a believer"],["كَمَن","like (him) who"],["كَانَ","is"],["فَاسِقٗاۚ","defiantly disobedient"],["لَّا","Not"],["يَسۡتَوُۥنَ","they are equal"]]},{"s":13,"a":39,"en":"Allah eliminates what He wills or confirms, and with Him is the Mother of the Book.","w":[["يَمۡحُواْ","(Is) eliminated"],["ٱللَّهُ","(by) Allah"],["مَا","what"],["يَشَآءُ","He wills"],["وَيُثۡبِتُۖ","and confirms"],["وَعِندَهُۥٓ","and with Him"],["أُمُّ","(is) the Mother (of) the Book"],["ٱلۡكِتَٰبِ","(is) the Mother (of) the Book"]]},{"s":94,"a":6,"en":"Indeed, with hardship [will be] ease.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["مَعَ","with"],["ٱلۡعُسۡرِ","the hardship"],["يُسۡرٗا","(is) ease"]]},{"s":1,"a":1,"en":"In the name of Allah, the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful.","w":[["بِسۡمِ","In (the) name"],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah"],["ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنِ","the Most Gracious"],["ٱلرَّحِيمِ","the Most Merciful"]]},{"s":83,"a":33,"en":"But they had not been sent as guardians over them.","w":[["وَمَآ","But not"],["أُرۡسِلُواْ","they had been sent"],["عَلَيۡهِمۡ","over them"],["حَٰفِظِينَ","(as) guardians"]]},{"s":35,"a":20,"en":"Nor are the darknesses and the light,","w":[["وَلَا","And not"],["ٱلظُّلُمَٰتُ","the darkness [es]"],["وَلَا","and not"],["ٱلنُّورُ","[the] light"]]},{"s":73,"a":13,"en":"And food that chokes and a painful punishment -","w":[["وَطَعَامٗا","And food"],["ذَا","that"],["غُصَّةٖ","chokes"],["وَعَذَابًا","and a punishment"],["أَلِيمٗا","painful"]]},{"s":53,"a":50,"en":"And that He destroyed the first [people of] 'Aad","w":[["وَأَنَّهُۥٓ","And that He"],["أَهۡلَكَ","destroyed"],["عَادًا","Aad"],["ٱلۡأُولَىٰ","the first"]]},{"s":58,"a":21,"en":"Allah has written, \"I will surely overcome, I and My messengers.\" Indeed, Allah is Powerful and Exalted in Might.","w":[["كَتَبَ","Allah has decreed"],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah has decreed"],["لَأَغۡلِبَنَّ","Surely,I will overcome"],["أَنَا۠","I"],["وَرُسُلِيٓۚ","and My Messengers"],["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah"],["قَوِيٌّ","(is) All-Strong"],["عَزِيزٞ","All-Mighty"]]},{"s":52,"a":30,"en":"Or do they say [of you], \"A poet for whom we await a misfortune of time?\"","w":[["أَمۡ","Or"],["يَقُولُونَ","(do) they say"],["شَاعِرٞ","A poet"],["نَّتَرَبَّصُ","we wait"],["بِهِۦ","for him"],["رَيۡبَ","a misfortune of time"],["ٱلۡمَنُونِ","a misfortune of time"]]},{"s":114,"a":4,"en":"From the evil of the retreating whisperer -","w":[["مِن","From"],["شَرِّ","(the) evil"],["ٱلۡوَسۡوَاسِ","(of) the whisperer"],["ٱلۡخَنَّاسِ","the one who withdraws"]]},{"s":43,"a":89,"en":"So turn aside from them and say, \"Peace.\" But they are going to know.","w":[["فَٱصۡفَحۡ","So turn away"],["عَنۡهُمۡ","from them"],["وَقُلۡ","and say"],["سَلَٰمٞۚ","Peace"],["فَسَوۡفَ","But soon"],["يَعۡلَمُونَ","they will know"]]},{"s":84,"a":10,"en":"But as for he who is given his record behind his back,","w":[["وَأَمَّا","But as for"],["مَنۡ","(him) who"],["أُوتِيَ","is given"],["كِتَٰبَهُۥ","his record"],["وَرَآءَ","behind"],["ظَهۡرِهِۦ","his back"]]},{"s":103,"a":2,"en":"Indeed, mankind is in loss,","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ","mankind"],["لَفِي","(is) surely,in"],["خُسۡرٍ","loss"]]},{"s":97,"a":4,"en":"The angels and the Spirit descend therein by permission of their Lord for every matter.","w":[["تَنَزَّلُ","Descend"],["ٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","the Angels"],["وَٱلرُّوحُ","and the Spirit"],["فِيهَا","therein"],["بِإِذۡنِ","by (the) permission"],["رَبِّهِم","(of) their Lord"],["مِّن","for"],["كُلِّ","every"],["أَمۡرٖ","affair"]]},{"s":41,"a":8,"en":"Indeed, those who believe and do righteous deeds - for them is a reward uninterrupted.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who"],["ءَامَنُواْ","believe"],["وَعَمِلُواْ","and do"],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ","righteous deeds"],["لَهُمۡ","for them"],["أَجۡرٌ","(is) a reward"],["غَيۡرُ","never ending"],["مَمۡنُونٖ","never ending"]]},{"s":8,"a":21,"en":"And do not be like those who say, \"We have heard,\" while they do not hear.","w":[["وَلَا","And (do) not"],["تَكُونُواْ","be"],["كَٱلَّذِينَ","like those who"],["قَالُواْ","say"],["سَمِعۡنَا","We heard"],["وَهُمۡ","while they"],["لَا","(do) not"],["يَسۡمَعُونَ","hear"]]},{"s":27,"a":1,"en":"Ta, Seen. These are the verses of the Qur'an and a clear Book","w":[["طسٓۚ","Ta Seen"],["تِلۡكَ","These"],["ءَايَٰتُ","(are the) Verses"],["ٱلۡقُرۡءَانِ","(of) the Quran"],["وَكِتَابٖ","and a Book"],["مُّبِينٍ","clear"]]},{"s":88,"a":1,"en":"Has there reached you the report of the Overwhelming [event]?","w":[["هَلۡ","Has"],["أَتَىٰكَ","(there) come to you"],["حَدِيثُ","(the) news"],["ٱلۡغَٰشِيَةِ","(of) the Overwhelming"]]}]